    "en": "Citation and commencement"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "1. These Rules are the Housing Developers (Compoundable Offences) Rules 2025 and come into operation on 1 July 2025."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "SG-H1861-A2",
   "no": 2,
   "noLabel": {
    "en": "2."
   },
   "heading": {
    "en": "Compoundable offences"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "2. An offence under section 4(8) or (9), 12A(2), 12B(3), 12C(5), 12D(2) or 12E(6) of the Act may be compounded by the Controller in accordance with section 27A of the Act."
   }
